**Given:**

If x + dfrac{1}{1+dfrac{1}{3+dfrac{1}{2}}} = 1

**Formula used:**

Simplify the nested fractions step by step.

**Calculation:**

dfrac{1}{3+dfrac{1}{2}} = dfrac{1}{dfrac{7}{2}} = dfrac{2}{7}

⇒ dfrac{1}{1+dfrac{2}{7}} = dfrac{1}{dfrac{9}{7}} = dfrac{7}{9}

⇒ x + dfrac{7}{9} = 1

⇒ x = 1 - dfrac{7}{9}

⇒ x = dfrac{9}{9} - dfrac{7}{9}

⇒ x = dfrac{2}{9}

**∴ The correct answer is option (1).**

**Given:**

Downstream speed = 33 km/h

Upstream speed = 27 km/h

**Formula used:**

Speed of boat in still water = dfrac{{Downstream speed} + {Upstream speed}}{2}

**Calculation:**

{Speed of boat in still water} = dfrac{33 + 27}{2}

⇒ dfrac{60}{2}

⇒ 30 km/h

**∴ The correct answer is option 1.**
